@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Student
boundary UI
control Reservation
control Core
title S1 - Reserve rental (Core API v1.1, D-015/D-018)
Student -> UI: Confirm selected vehicle
UI -> Reservation: Reservation resource ID, vehicle, origin,\noptional destination, minimum, duration, version
Reservation -> Reservation: Validate trusted actor and fields\nRead own existing Reservation first
alt Same owned booking and immutable intent
  Reservation --> UI: Existing recorded booking; no writes
else New intent
  Reservation -> Core: Enter core.unit_of_work()
  group One repository transaction under Core lock
    Reservation -> Reservation: Recheck own record and live user quota
    Reservation -> Core: get_config().as_of; get_vehicle()
    Core --> Reservation: Authoritative time and current vehicle
    Reservation -> Reservation: Check origin, eligibility and requested version
    Reservation -> Core: place_claim(VEHICLE, RESERVATION, booking ID, now, expiry)
    Core --> Reservation: Claim or Err
    Reservation -> Core: transition_vehicle(RESERVE, version, claim_id, min_battery)
    Core --> Reservation: Reserved vehicle or Err
    Reservation -> Reservation: uow.repository.add(Confirmed Reservation)
    Reservation -> Core: uow.commit() only if every operation succeeded
    Core --> Reservation: Commit result; publish Core events after commit
  end
  Reservation --> UI: Booking / explicit error
end
UI --> Student: Reservation ID and ten-minute deadline
note over Reservation,Core
  Any Err exits without commit: all writes roll back.
  No Trip or destination hold. Origin remains occupied.
  Race conflict: reread M2 record for identical winning request.
  No Core-to-M2 reservation-read callback or result store.
end note
@enduml
